 // Hillside_sites_3, with North and South made explicitly UNORDERED.
 // Identical to Hillside_sites_3.oxcal except that the two branch Sequences
 // are wrapped in a single Phase("Sites"), so the outer Sequence sees one
 // unordered group instead of two consecutive ones.
